{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114168","id":3114926345,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc65qgEJ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114168","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114168.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114168.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114168","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114168/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114168/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114168/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0fc7db2b35f1a451ce238ccc8fe0981f520d41c6","number":114168,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add Code Actions and a few \"Quick Fix\" actions for warnings [reverted]","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13232 .\r\n\r\nThis PR adds support for \"Code Actions\" and \"Quick Fixes\" in Godot's script editor, for GDScript. This aims to work similarly to [VS Code's Code Actions](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editing/refactoring).\r\n\r\nEssentially, when a GDScript warning is pushed, a list of Code Actions can optionally be supplied as well. These will be offered to the user via a lightbulb icon that appears in the script editor gutter. The option to suppress the warning with `@warning_ignore` is often provided, and depending on the warning, a more specific fix may also be provided.\r\n\r\nCurrently the following fixes are provided:\r\n\r\n- UNUSED_VARIABLE\r\n  - Add underscore to variable name\r\n  - Remove variable declaration\r\n- UNUSED_PARAMETER\r\n  - Add underscore to parameter name\r\n- MISSING_TOOL\r\n  - Add `@tool`\r\n- GET_NODE_DEFAULT_WITHOUT_ONREADY\r\n  - Add `@onready`\r\n- UNUSED_PRIVATE_CLASS_VARIABLE\r\n  - Remove underscore from class variable name\r\n  - Remove class variable declaration\r\n- UNTYPED_DECLARATION\r\n  - Add type specifier\r\n- INFERRED_DECLARATION\r\n  - Add type specifier\r\n- UNUSED_LOCAL_CONSTANT\r\n  - Add underscore to constant name\r\n  - Remove constant declaration\r\n- ASSERT_ALWAYS_TRUE\r\n  - Remove assert statement\r\n- REDUNDANT_AWAIT\r\n  - Remove \"await\"\r\n- STATIC_CALLED_ON_INSTANCE\r\n  - Call from type\r\n- MISSING_AWAIT\r\n  - Add \"await\"\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cabba728-afb5-4559-8fa4-aa3b6ad5f102\r\n\r\n## TODOs\r\n\r\nNone at the moment!\r\n\r\n## For future PRs\r\n\r\nThese are things that would be nice to add in future PRs but are **out of scope for this PR:**\r\n\r\n- View and run code actions associated with warnings in the warning panel\r\n- Create function stubs to match nonexistent referenced functions\r\n- Create signals to match nonexistent referenced signals\r\n- Create properties to match nonexistent referenced properties(?)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","u